# Testing

Use **only** `@iobroker/testing` for integration tests.

## Scripts (after scaffold)

- `npm run test` — unit + package validation
- `npm run test:js` — Mocha unit tests
- `npm run test:package` — package / io-package / admin JSON
- `npm run test:integration` — local only

## Rules

- Mock Moonraker HTTP and Creality WS in unit tests — never hit a live printer in CI
- Configure harness via `harness.objects.setObject()` before start
- Plan sufficient timeouts for async start

## CI order

Lint first (`check-and-lint`), then `adapter-tests`.
